---
const size = 8;
const active = 7;
const cells = Array.from({ length: size ** 2 }, (_, index) => {
  const diagonal = Math.floor(index / size) + index % size;
  return diagonal === active ? 'active' : diagonal < active ? 'done' : 'pending';
});
---

<figure class="wavefront">
  <figcaption><strong>DTW Wavefront</strong><span>OpenMP</span></figcaption>
  <div class="matrix" aria-hidden="true">
    {cells.map((state) => <span class={state}></span>)}
  </div>
  <p>같은 반대각선의 셀을 병렬로 계산합니다.</p>
</figure>

<style>
  .wavefront {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    margin: 0;
    padding: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 2.4rem);
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  figcaption {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: .4rem 1rem;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: .875rem;
  }
  figcaption span { border: 1px solid currentColor; padding: .125rem .45rem; }
  .matrix {
    width: min(100%, 16.5rem);
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    align-self: center;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(8, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: .27rem;
    transform: scale(.94);
    transition: transform 250ms ease;
  }
  .wavefront:hover .matrix { transform: scale(1); }
  .matrix span { border: 1px solid rgb(31 29 27 / .38); }
  .matrix .done { background: rgb(31 29 27 / .2); }
  .matrix .active { background: var(--paper); border-color: var(--paper); }
  p { font-size: .9rem; margin: 0; }
</style>
